{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30014_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1a7dde54b91715e0f1a3d90d4a185a98349f3c05ca518850675614c247490412",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c76806e7869f0f8f5759c462cd9850733e989aa87a51c0f8056f37fc18c3916",
      "text": "全新的热情",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2fb1a6f84b0a32407f3c0f86272d9bd80019cab54b78ff781038ade050aab8c",
      "text": "THE 虎牙道确定出演音乐节目。\n虽然武觉得如果是电视节目，或许能被\n弟弟妹妹看到而干劲十足，\n但其他出演者却因为他们曾是格斗家\n而轻视他们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c76806e7869f0f8f5759c462cd9850733e989aa87a51c0f8056f37fc18c3916",
      "text": "全新的热情",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d3ae6e6d361a15608b4a0a6067288664dfc4ce54d1ffada12e82a5493add53a",
      "text": "给我们的，是电视节目的出演邀约吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae581757f2b8efaecec887b83a0b1a02c74fb398cf2db3cf7d36dab932cb93c0",
      "text": "是的！音乐节目那边发来了联络……\n说务必想请各位出演！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0843578a2d1ce93f46322bd77360fee0eb88460df3e726561755ca7bb89a1694",
      "text": "（电视上的音乐节目吗……\n被弟弟和妹妹看到的几率也很大啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:362996a3c181b343b81e5a36138737f6e0c9f0f2dcdc12e85d2bef8ea0d56b37",
      "text": "（这份工作，绝对不能放过。\n必须拿出十足的干劲去迎接挑战）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b59ae17758d5cd48ae7b5d6ae85f6959820257a764fceca95a95bd5f7684e77",
      "text": "这份邀约，我们接下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:715ae24525ae6a4faa995769ac6ea6d2a145832a017d569883b40a4490bfb2b3",
      "text": "很干劲十足嘛，武。既然这样，师父！\n就放心地交给我们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:789c0956b95a209fa210304b54577acd17712109c0f7093dd39c31b3d758a0a5",
      "text": "哼。不管你再怎么起劲，也根本\n比不上本大爷就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70b92da219072e6c807259d2885d6d22867accc009995071a41a244bb7531bd1",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー。\n我有个请求。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35567e2729e89340c73ac8a29a0d7388f9e5754f24c076f0bd32474687e63588",
      "text": "在正式录制之前，希望能把课程训练的时间\n安排得比平时更多一些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb99c6227979d62b98d677533bf6fc9de0f48dcd6e1d87099eada6202dc30aa4",
      "text": "这次的收录，我一定要让它成功。\n拜托你考虑一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a957552de8290e5cff1fa807401e7df26b48769ae313e82baecdc1d81c590e97",
      "text": "我就猜到你会这么说，已经提前安排好了！\n大家一起打造出最棒的舞台吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fba3ffbb76bd0c2cdf51e78042e9191b571fd0d0d99d173c4bf24c504215e0c",
      "text": "对台本当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09c2cbfff0ec7ea141402be72139d491581caed4ea1a8020ee9d2b125bc9e590",
      "text": "我们是第一个出场吗……\n必须打起精神来才行啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91a6467edccfada960f8a575b0b7286e8cee267db218fd09dfc59fa9e1cf3f45",
      "text": "好的！请务必借着各位的气势，\n牢牢抓住观众的心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc6a80af421bdaf78db0130d36e1069726f0934e59bfa15efeebbed29bff142d",
      "text": "请交给我们吧！为了把节目的气氛炒热起来，\n我们一定会把这个角色扮演好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d13b5c7888e3f0209fbccbec24800afc02d748110ff327f616797e285d4e34dd",
      "text": "哼，打头阵倒也不坏。\n正适合本大爷！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9489b00b16f83968ef1b2ad96042352d508cd9128fe306951957170b922aedb0",
      "text": "很期待你们的发挥哦！\n就拜托各位带来一场热血沸腾的舞台了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b122b3403b3b59cce8adbb15106fac23a563e81ed9eb8a6f375050bb94b05cda",
      "text": "好的。\n请交给我们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000073:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c06bec2d17ca298ddc78047d1048113a76b39007f0d0346335dc0372e75a243c",
      "text": "对台本结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a34b14e4f314c11a5fedabbbc1ff5558403fa40e7287c11baf824a336b21257",
      "text": "碰头对台本辛苦了。\n那么，我们回事务所吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ffc8029151c842d34ee73408c79a62f50beee577e92bc5ddfd8d2d92a8310f2",
      "text": "你们几个，能耽误一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:110e54535ec8aef2638fff16f282bcad1fbbc8a1a11d6ed559a437ddd0e5d88b",
      "text": "哈啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a1890ad083ccc20072e5b1a611033fa54213dfe7fa2f0b621c38c26efce07f",
      "text": "哎呀，好吓人啊。真让人想不到这会是\n对待同一档节目的共演者该有的态度。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f478a8a8bd859dfbf411df7f522aab37022be7451205011f95da869af394d17",
      "text": "……找我们有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:707b5f2efc3912f7252fb1ede746763720b4dc7ef7a5fe9ea296b75c2edc5776",
      "text": "就想随便打个招呼。听说是一群前格斗家凑在一起，\n我们好奇究竟是什么样的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4f01972f3464e3e1e06b4d54dbc5b303002476614b5f008be2c34f97c7a0e97",
      "text": "呃……那个组合名叫什么来着？\n刚才虽然听过了，但已经忘了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_b:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a20ee028f5c0ba2d4384d7f30291953db9aa2128393ac1648c2086a24b1138e6",
      "text": "哈哈，幸会。\n我们叫“THE 虎牙道”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67087800540f4a30388f87745415ab53a5421b3a86d41ff59c32fd40a9525354",
      "text": "如你们所知，是一群前格斗家凑成的组合！\n当天还请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74061893a535c2c2bcb000c03dec54a8233a6f7577a0c55839cd17a93c0a71db",
      "text": "各位也是出演同一档节目的吧。当天\n一起为了把节目办得热热闹闹而努力吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98543593fc814082122e1ed74ee8789665de81eb329824394dd49f5673e69699",
      "text": "一起……啊。跟这么热气腾腾的组合\n说什么一起努力，也有点……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d349066a0e2615bf6fa06ba9dcae8a85a27b9feca79c60da5b3deb544ffbc7f4",
      "text": "管他是前格斗家还是什么……这年头，\n搞什么热血之类的早就过时了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46ad311f3bf0b4155d95b26a29510b02e3e7b106ebd4ce0eeb2536ceed50a4de",
      "text": "（……真敢说啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e5c37d33be71f0a456cd200339c06b3807e9e05700d09edf9040b5162b37ff8",
      "text": "（明明对我们根本不怎么了解。\n仅仅因为是前格斗家，就自顾自地信口开河……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_c:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:546e10e373edcbcb6d3abbe8898fa772851270e60f163c24898968c85b493d0c",
      "text": "就是说嘛。\n反正实力肯定也上不了台面吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_c:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df009227cb3ead8f93e6eb6a5b9316134d96b618ae9f806b919e571d1803767a",
      "text": "（未免有些太过分了……得去阻止他们！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_c:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3bf01242d2e9407c6931a7f10cf7a0321bb919610f53a8c8fbec84f1532c0fd",
      "text": "听你们在旁边唧唧歪歪半天，净扯些得寸进尺的\n屁话……找揍是吧喂！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aedbda312e1e218dfa22954f862d98143e619e4c7476f3e7c15dc756502ae78c",
      "text": "抛开另外两个人不谈，本大爷可是最强的！\n现在就让你们见识见识本大爷的实力如何啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c86c65ba8d4bb22150b32e044d5066a0bb11b31db9129bea5b3177cac6872ade",
      "text": "冷静点，涟。这里是对台本的地方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c7b7cb1a2f36d52e356ac2b14020e1649a5dc791882c49a621b80e4d863a01d",
      "text": "涟先生，我明白您的心情，\n但请冷静下来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:955f9c0aa4dd5fa9237cd20825db8d61ee4664d6d59bd50a014fe5894efe62e5",
      "text": "哈啊？先挑事的明明是那帮家伙吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bea7fd822118cd237091ca8b3faf3a36f43688813f460f0d638a7eea06207e4",
      "text": "……真、真是群野蛮的家伙。\n果然前格斗家就是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5199d9ee53e319f57e7dae3050632c995c3bf9ada5fec2d5ad92a45aae919f8b",
      "text": "快走吧。再跟他们说下去，\n连我们都会被当成一伙的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f003f767db3013f6b9a0f9219193e57161c0824d1e274280b0b42f38cd0d5dee",
      "text": "喂，站住……切！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:140eb451e61f385a0c0e52b6d540be6de59b9caa91a3bc39cf1a37f4f1e45c5d",
      "text": "……动手是不对的。\n圆城寺先生，谢谢你拦住他。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f502269a701aaff69ed27552fe9bb28bb684d2e7ce9915a26e6eb8fc453ea9f",
      "text": "……我心里也有怨气。\n但就算跟他们打嘴仗，他们也不可能心服口服。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fdc4cb406fccf0574ad6138efe60d2a8a916b4abe2a35bc704f2dc73dab6873",
      "text": "为了不再被他们用轻视的态度对待，\n唯有在正式演出的舞台上让他们见识见识了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8246688b5046fe2a9922d7c7e7377aaf6a8fd23f8853ccd5d8b08320bf0191b9",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n请把练习课程的时间，安排得比现在更多一些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9d8622585f3ad2e83def9ebd790bcafd69942199f57d8c4e3c0a4be57678acd",
      "text": "呼……稍微休息一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:118d6d4742198e3d6c7da5f0897d7a573caf1d13cbdf4de026d29f3c472fbb9a",
      "text": "武，劲头很足嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d95b7e1d0b9ba77a57f41dbefddbc9fd312a0359f72ee231bf4234589ea1ef6",
      "text": "嗯。被人劈头盖脸说了那样的话，可不合我的脾气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44090489feec3ded2dbefde18570602fa4c8cd9a8b927cb11b18ca078f27169f",
      "text": "（一开始虽然只是想着弟弟和妹妹可能会看到，\n才鼓足干劲去对待的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3213a1ba0cda0509774719df7c3fa6a40ca95bd0812d42f9e0a516f1a709fe47",
      "text": "（但感觉现在已经不仅仅是这样了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b5df0db8ebe48e07fcd6b5813fec7e6472a4a64797053f1a5ea46613da952f6",
      "text": "怎么了，武。在想事情吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb56702e8334515a7f2c1a5c11aaf88feb5c918f1d5bdb159d3968269725518b",
      "text": "……圆城寺先生。\n我有些事想找你商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd4fd63f380ea71bd14ac628cd02fee27d1bb219d1f98e3d058f5fc9617afbb",
      "text": "我们THE 虎牙道，向来凭借热血的表演\n获得好评。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbfe7e6eaa1220306a2daa047e43419eaacda93c1a6bdb143d9d4ae2fff00102",
      "text": "但是，在接下来的工作中，\n我想展现出全新的THE 虎牙道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7215e5e0634b347bdfb00a0e25641c3538091d62cfab71665c5f27c15217e8ab",
      "text": "我想狠狠甩在那些家伙脸上，\n让他们知道我们可不只是空有一身热血而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:090b21b9c6bfb0899ed098b288cc00b56ffd2baceaae52d8ffd66abd00b71a6f",
      "text": "全新的THE 虎牙道啊。\n这不是很好嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0a9689e66f05001e5b7c41322790dfb55e33603789c1cbd180fd0392d756300",
      "text": "这么一来……光靠重复以往那种方式的练习课程，\n或许会有些困难呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5321c1c67b7f83dc56d0b251af29a1f4029feabca88c1d622ec4933d36ee76a",
      "text": "好。先找师父商量一下看看吧。\n那样的话，说不定能找到不错的方法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000142:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e191d218193e22c4d0ba25295c7d39259a3cf607611e144cb2c422e4ef7e36e",
      "text": "师父，辛苦了。\n现在方便打扰一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000144:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dde6c1cf6cf75d85dcf78e23bbeeaaa8415d5f8a782f1d851e291990c1926cf7",
      "text": "武在这次的工作上，\n似乎有些事情\n想和您商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000146:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:098575562c25e83a94ca24365e1776bf31bacb284b1a12dbe2136fcb39c78ff4",
      "text": "嗯\n之前遇到的那些共演的\n偶像们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000148:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8059e69ee4a47d43eb7f31a2f83026289293bd9e1a12f81e55704a09e3815430",
      "text": "我无论如何\n都想让他们刮目相看",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000150:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd285a2dd911accbc644c5b9096be949d5c2d9c1cb31ab5749402ba6d92c5fe2",
      "text": "为此，我想把之后的\n课程练习计划\n重新调整一下",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000152:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c55d4b878df63d50ff372587f8319ae3821c1cf3fe8c6bce31cf184b4a7c34",
      "text": "我明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000152:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0c88f4763d1f6617aeb7bc205529b572dde13f1d5a681845c3f75af6b04cefd",
      "text": "我明白了！既然是这样的话，\n我们就去和教练先生\n以及编舞师先生商量吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000155:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5773be7d3dedf7cbda8a0ea503873b85d558dcbb78a636f491ed206a375eda3f",
      "text": "谢谢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000157:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30d042242a7923732cf22266c13010ee15c76940b79bf664e83187fd0d902c2d",
      "text": "喂从刚才起就吵死了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000159:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34eaf34d8445ebccf12dee93b9f508e9085fcf71381b312811da24a0341852c2",
      "text": "闭嘴",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000161:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af29cfeba567007895719d75981fd8e0dcdd9ba6b0d146c59e74ea038fd78a5c",
      "text": "不是，这可是关系到我们\nTHE 虎牙道的\n正经事哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_e:cmd-000163:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef3de2b7bf4bbdf6e1d792b74ba76578c942bbe39af7a871fb5addcabe00bdf0",
      "text": "涟明天也一起去商量吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2484a3723e7a086c1a7550abcde6797b8181b4fba2f73f6a534a6f3a73a4ea7",
      "text": "（接受了武先生他们的咨询，\n把练习课程的难度提升后，已经过了一周……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90d367bf13f2a46ec6c05935a72a3db6624302a16881426cd7cd42bceb46738c",
      "text": "（即便是THE 虎牙道的各位，看起来也吃不消了。\n……脸上已经开始露出疲态）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e71d93ba09d89b401b6d9b48cdfdb148bd535d73c0fd476ac1bcf81e44bbef7",
      "text": "（呼……这个训练强度，相当吃力啊。\n但是，能切实感觉到自己有所成长）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4a996dab3171bc353af65da75422fca3a8c0738cb3483e0e9bf1b7fce812515",
      "text": "这样一来，只要在空闲时间里\n也抽出时间来自主加练的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:645d003a7b46c99074f494f035f9790ecd89d405d542e92a9913a905a5eb5937",
      "text": "武先生，不要紧吧？\n感觉时间排得相当满呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65e5970c72f4389677203f6e7541fdcc96325e1d0aca390a9afad65b76ec0c59",
      "text": "嗯，我没事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61b54698586ebe3d0bf28cbf13118a0386fb58e32f34e0308080821a72692aa4",
      "text": "现在状态非常好。\n就保持这股势头，一直努力到正式演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70cb31bc9b3eb350aab10b9fd115a0b057bf07397ff8cdb93bb91ecbf4a700e0",
      "text": "既然武先生都这么说了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cd4d0a77cd2231fd2aee3ddbf4d4d42e9af6e2765d71d05c6e0f87427bc4c30",
      "text": "那我就先回事务所了。\n请注意千万不要勉强自己哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67645e84d05b1041c45f8089e78a66f709142becc4a92b4e90df4ba072060a49",
      "text": "嗯，我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0aad4ac3e1a782badd5b9e28698a777d37910543e0f95af3d1948c4d1c763da",
      "text": "（虽然对师父是那么说的，但武那家伙，\n可以说是把自己逼到了极限在练习啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d3e9299adca0fc75a42cb2602facb218af256040533f370a1f2290fe79b2b58",
      "text": "（虽然大家也都很努力……但他甚至克扣休息时间，\n连饭都是狼吞虎咽地吃完，一直坚持在练）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6345190323b372e549604e254ccf0e3e8b3012cf6a9fca9189d8ecf761833669",
      "text": "武，要不要休息一下？\n你今天可是一直没停过吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0b52c3034a35451da312d093863673de3bc40a3bd0baf8cc198fb1b01db6f72",
      "text": "没事。我还能行。\n比起这个，舞蹈动作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000207:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1042e096bb10d491ff1798a4728fd45389346829ceeaba5a48330391a919172",
      "text": "喂，小不点。\n你这家伙，干嘛搞得这么热气腾腾的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_f:cmd-000210:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7213283c1803ed06a320d2d54ef5930ae1362ea3dad81cf1475c1d2461455226",
      "text": "你到底是在死命拼个什么劲啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bb7fe2195db8120954a6262ac7285539be20007ed9a5ac93a02eae0011361a6",
      "text": "虽然没办法解释得很清楚……\n但我只是受不了被人劈头盖脸说成那样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72f8e135a3d708caa8f59dfdf4780f38367abd528eabb3251eaeb8f7d48a335f",
      "text": "哈啊？你还在介意那群杂鱼吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27c7f54aee9b59038506388e1fb08c21970e176ab20189564ed1b4602e820c3e",
      "text": "没错。我想通过更多的训练，\n让他们收回那些话。仅此而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05326e566f8e9dedfbe7ade73a337782beab504fb3668a9702e049fa069b65d9",
      "text": "哼。因为小不点是个杂鱼嘛。\n不拼命的话就赶不上本大爷了是吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1100b10dccdae8177e7aab8cd267b373f1310ec70f6cd9345431254990a41f3",
      "text": "那你就尽管努力吧！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4577c4cfecf7f2b7034175954a8ed943373c9917fd0fe5155c137b38f53c1a7",
      "text": "喂，拉面店的！\n本大爷肚子饿了。拿饭来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb593e1209b3bd1118b155c1ec6328feee8d0beec4a2dfb15af48562180bb3a9",
      "text": "这样啊。那去买点什么吧。\n武你也一起去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86ec84202a40a41ce17908eaf45576ff9ba90f731ef8e323c75c8b85ed9d4811",
      "text": "我不用了。比起那个，我想留下来加练。\n只要跟制作人拿到这里的使用许可……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0592972fa565c1566a3134258861b05a545e0c49946217c3001a2e82172fafb",
      "text": "啊，那件事的话没问题。我就猜到武会这么说，\n事先已经拜托过师父了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97ed04276233b6a748959680ab69b802fd934bee088f7e61982b355914b3f969",
      "text": "是这样吗。\n谢谢你，圆城寺先生。帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24d21d1cd68088a18e54fc75b684ce2fa9e46a3adc97c947a987bb0a6ca63708",
      "text": "哈哈，别客气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_g:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:489323e9cd860842056764d4ff642a6e95ea4911f4eb2857f8455a29a2cb7a17",
      "text": "我们待会儿也会再回来集合的。\n回头见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09afe7a804696d6194a8d796fb88ff43293c40eae93d61c6c8b56abc552c7cd5",
      "text": "（在自己内心深处暗自翻腾的，这份情感……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f0708865dde808ea547648f31320f7064af232baf60e50b90cf6fd81977559d",
      "text": "“管他是前格斗家还是什么……这年头，\n搞什么热血之类的早就过时了吧。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f7ece67c7ba1fb8e4f41efd251017218813883fc4139f9c89ee08c6b4f10ba5",
      "text": "“就是说嘛。\n反正实力肯定也上不了台面吧。”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4fa83ce631834a4072800f64dd48953ae6d04b8495dd138e6209c0ccfb30d68",
      "text": "（为什么那些话，会让我这么耿耿于怀）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000076:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bcf0fb8198846f8f9be1920ec7a38420fe198c27b1ea49219c5b459d6d62158",
      "text": "然后，正式演出的前一天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67254f1507297a993441a4ae30a9882c39446af33343494884b1f15a7abeae72",
      "text": "……呼！\n刚才那遍，感觉相当不错不是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8da41c46d8c170e75cb8133ea724dab59fff5a14c25c01604be769b9c5281ddc",
      "text": "嗯，确实是。\n截止到今天的练习成果，已经充分体现出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0ec73b3d4809ded254593da04bdb0e9ee465d99d3ce072623a3a378d6fa6983",
      "text": "圆城寺先生的动作，也比以往任何时候都要好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e135a30934214e1a7477a07cc1a2377085871c57365224ca5cf1df771ed75297",
      "text": "哈哈，谢谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b133f4fb93024da86b4ed42d4b5e9b6e9d6e0a734f19914c0e8d8a1fc4470b4d",
      "text": "我也不能输给武嘛。\n自主练习的时间可是增加了不少哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b47e58d9542ecbecfb29ee5cb1b7ddb429e512fdfd2beefa90b7b6ff536745dc",
      "text": "哧，小不点有多努力关我屁事！只要本大爷\n稍微认真一点，这点程度还不是轻轻松松！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3519815f58631ba8630c96298900a6bc2afd1b8093943f65acbf837145635c75",
      "text": "虽然嘴上这么说，但涟背地里\n也好好练了舞蹈呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d8c91613677634146231e637d4006bfc303f1301545bad21c30b9ae20ce177",
      "text": "照这个状态迎战的话，明天一定能给大家展现出\n最精彩的绝佳表现吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_h:cmd-000195:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04727c9d392753072b1f50286e12b05eeb96001d16505f0f194040be58527699",
      "text": "嗯，没错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ad827ccb3913603f4ca8bf23341e0db43a48004e652b08c34affbf4881961cc",
      "text": "接着到了录制当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e97f4f5a426bfe9da55b1bda251f05256ad59a9dda743f6416cccb2d839ddacb",
      "text": "好，彩排也顺利结束了。\n保持这个势头，正式演出也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41c26080fd26cd353ee78f93c75d4b8188e870a711c53fa94b60a3774d408a4f",
      "text": "哎呀，你们好。\n彩排感觉怎么样啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7fa572d3febe2e35cc283bf3825e34dad67be8fdd49b7e155668ad71d5a323e",
      "text": "哈啊？什么啊，又是你们这帮家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb6cb14a3bc3fca1e41c23daabe5f5f40c974b667de3a1936f165b55d5f18209",
      "text": "哈哈，态度还是一如既往呢。\n亏我们还特地过来想向你们道声谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb9da795465d412008ca0f48291633c1739cfba89415c3714e13b338efade7ee",
      "text": "道谢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e63867c0160b4507924fd6ebcb18457d8629173ee641de1b14ededdbe7dec6a4",
      "text": "是啊。多亏有你们这样的组合在，\n我们的表演才能显得更加出彩嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_i:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd66010ff119644fdc23122f56bd744ea67c5ceb9347657a651fc2485b7609d2",
      "text": "嘛，你们就尽量做好暖场工作吧。负责炒热\n节目气氛这种事，全权交给我们也没关系。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_i:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07955a1753cfb049c36d1aa827808dd43281c18912e6c5ecea2ba27139d4c4db",
      "text": "我们可没打算把大展身手的机会让给你们。\n我们已经练就了足以把这句话说出口的自信。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_i:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a9a003a15523bb29171e0334c2cdd069c36026a9d097fe994b798b8bf0f0063",
      "text": "为了让你们在录制结束后再也说不出同样的话……\n我们会用自己的表演，让你们闭嘴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_j:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:204e3bb1c14fb911c73848c280dcf24219972305dc57c2d90476af022f0e2296",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_j:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcbca96f8c8622b4f2f0bdd20897f9c3f32189a11ce4eec0f4159dafbdcfcfc3",
      "text": "（切……！小不点这家伙，\n动作比平时还要利落啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9207095d8e45cea0ae20241e9093552f9b936b78dfdc95236d5a0b1f9af1db94",
      "text": "（哼，虽然还是比不上本大爷就是了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d57da887640a90a4b1ffb45f1f4c3eaea81046087033af954617c18d4b1ae9e",
      "text": "（真厉害啊，武。练习的成果自然不用说，\n今天的气魄截然不同……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1101a589dd158a45575b1b59778d255b05e566062de12ccfdb635196bd505d89",
      "text": "（不由得让人由衷钦佩啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87dc7edc5a48de8d32de51e3b563115cb59f72ba95b8563a0203207a762cd929",
      "text": "（我和涟都被武带动着，\n表现力在不断地攀升……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7535e27d142e31b44c4645a2c0dfd485b94a585b235d05b9f59289790dd59d1f",
      "text": "（……或许这档节目，\n会被弟弟和妹妹看到）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:106e04af83e28f9f6082ceccf0ae19132d24c78e1ec18a1f777e37bb11ce834a",
      "text": "（但是……现在存在于我心中的，\n已经不仅仅是想要与两人重逢的愿望了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70787bdb3a144d75b30f157798ca4a92a23f8c4821a38086372cc5b44dea1997",
      "text": "（也不是平时工作里常有的，对那家伙的竞争心，\n这一定……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5231b5c2922ee480739504e8a9cb3d190824a9b7cb16fcef97072e92233e56f5",
      "text": "（是因为想要让那些轻视我们的实力、否定了\n组合个性的偶像们刮目相看）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_j:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52d5dceed55c6459c28d3d2d76531370437670970c86aeecf9553d6e10ced730",
      "text": "（作为一名偶像，作为大河武的自尊心，\n在呐喊着“绝不想认输”啊……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b79086dda62e045ea68d58c9cbede61068d0cf72f1067ece86b14f587b05b4e0",
      "text": "谢谢大家。\n我们是THE 虎牙道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c88fba98556f3bd45c7aa5b42ac9799567592c4035c75652ed6574926a9dcc2b",
      "text": "好的，停机！\nTHE 虎牙道的各位辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66701a49594d9f3c761f617cd5d06fc9efd1db483c6580c2f45a665fa44084fd",
      "text": "各位，辛苦了！\n真是一场无可挑剔的精彩舞台！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d35488761ceb70f9cda60663fa0041126ab3b4c728c3ed52622c9f169106bf41",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●师父！\n非常感谢。太开心了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c5c3ff76efb4ba4ab3e2a69adcc850596f8541cb6a05a5472b6d7e47421ea7",
      "text": "哼，那种程度对本大爷来说不过是小菜一碟。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3800cc45e320b629b0e63c74fcd365f2e357ec1919ad80aa413659cde063d5bd",
      "text": "嘛，这样一来那些杂鱼\n也就无话可说了吧！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00b1b71e36d5e9286361268ff645b743c06d4e701a8c7449a79098ab6aff13ce",
      "text": "是啊，真是一场具有绝对压倒性的表演。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54163db7c138bdd67434679577beedeb1b83cef1d6561dc774d5ca7ff05dbd97",
      "text": "那么，我们回休息室吧。\n感想稍后请慢慢跟我聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f293df0a144071fd50f3031af7e96724e9fb819b86cd749623f528bd0ee1d083",
      "text": "好！\n那涟、武，我们回去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84a969c1c75d48cbba35cfd839a3b4537cb1e2b129759a132d714b514b1459a4",
      "text": "怎么了，武？\n不回去吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb3eeec317208eae2eeb448cf89eb26b8f84957e1b884f52feaaf19420938c6a",
      "text": "……没，这就来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000143:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc21e99714080445b99dfde5063325e649e4687b451d6ba80cefef75cbe0c215",
      "text": "辛苦了，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000145:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abad3d1aa3a07464871dc05b103f9655d0a31ad40855aa4faccafb3f8dbbce11",
      "text": "刚刚才解散就找你真不好意思。\n有句话我忘了跟你说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000147:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44376039067ce86d8d831fab3c8c8425ed45be34649d9f7344793e5813aedd4a",
      "text": "这次能由着我们的心意来做，\n谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000149:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4958fe41b04e75f25bf3f794b5334be2d5928e5f830fc5b42c1ab5fbb250a133",
      "text": "多亏有你的配合支持，\n才能呈现出令人满意的舞台。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000151:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb32d8c66ba2a196399d7b624976847de00cfed24eee3df263ac419afed16e66",
      "text": "这是大家共同努力的\n成果哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000152:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9c634a7b140d181a5d74896d1fdae967a13cfc8da3a646cebf76a7b95aac61f",
      "text": "呈现出了非常棒的\n舞台呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000155:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc75610bbac1964b0dda04d66affc6d9e9dbda04b96e836c62fbf4c11179281c",
      "text": "嗯。谢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000157:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a221abf6e15d946463dd3923c0b94c258ffeecd9e6ea18be7b71c455f0084ec",
      "text": "说起来在那之后，\n那些偶像过来道歉了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000159:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44b7c4f60f42e961c15b585867ac4555f860760573b847a12414fd450cab4d98",
      "text": "说是“之前摆出那副看不起人的态度，\n真的很对不起”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000161:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca84a21795ea5944db8659134b9467aca8baf5ae67647fb9c0f7889c172a726f",
      "text": "所以我觉得这件事，也算是有始有终地解决了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000163:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95f00c7c495d5288f2c9eb3911cf7554e8dd4158f47f2ea972870b407ebb690c",
      "text": "而且，他们的\n表现其实也很棒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_k:cmd-000165:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6300294a1ed24bc4467d5e601716ee21cc4af6bb2b3da0c9ad288e6c45360853",
      "text": "我们也必须努力不输给他们才行。\n那么，明天起也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
